    <div class="chart-panel" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
        <h2 data-tooltip="GitHub-style heatmap over the last 365 days. Each cell's shade reflects what % of that day's hydration goal was met; black = no data.">Hydration Heatmap (% of goal)</h2>
